Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:59.65,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}不知何时  伤口已经痊愈 yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:02.74,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Woo
